mandatory -- the scrutiny validator always runs them. `/security-review` only runs when relevant. `/test-app` and `/demo-video` are optional and project-specific -- you write these yourself for your project if you want browser testing or demo recordings.\n279:The first version was hand-written during a `/grill-me` session that produced the design decisions and shared vocabulary. The second version was built by Darkfactory itself -- Claude workers generated the skills from the specs, and a Codex code review caught issues that a fix worker addressed. Everything since then has been iterative improvement, and the system is still actively evolving.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
